     *
     * <p>This method validates the input strings to guard against malformed
     * versions that could cause {@link ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException} or
     * {@link NumberFormatException}. It expects the format {@code "x.y.z"}
     * where {@code x}, {@code y}, and {@code z} are integer values. If the
     * format is invalid, an {@link IllegalArgumentException} is thrown.
     *
