     *
     * <p>The method now performs a strict ownership check: the authenticated user
     * (obtained from {@link HttpServletRequest#getUserPrincipal()}) must match the
     * user ID extracted from the request URL. This prevents a user from modifying
     * another user's account, mitigating impersonation attacks.</p>
     *
